    "sections": {
        "description": "WENS Plumbing is a modern child theme of WENS Haelo, specifically designed for plumbing companies, electricians, home maintenance businesses, and other professional service providers. It features a clean, responsive, and conversion-focused design, with pre-designed sections to showcase services, company information, projects, testimonials, calls to action, blog posts, and contact details. Built with the WordPress Site Editor, WENS Plumbing allows for easy customization of layouts, colors, typography, headers, footers, and templates without requiring any coding skills. This lightweight theme is optimized for performance and provides everything needed to establish a professional online presence and effectively promote your home service business across all devices."
    },
